      "blockers": [
        "trigger IR does not generically classify target-free triggers caused by activated mana abilities, their resolution, or mana addition",
        "possible mana output from a triggered ability is not represented as a typed classifier",
        "no generic triggered-mana replay witness exists"
      ],
      "notes": [
        "Ordinary and delayed triggers are represented, but no partial trigger is promoted to a mana-ability classification."
      ]
