      "blockers": [
        "activation and immediate resolution occur within one synchronous call, with no serialized activation-in-progress guard",
        "recursive or replacement-driven attempts to reactivate the same ability cannot be independently expressed and audited"
      ],
      "notes": [
        "Synchronous execution makes ordinary reentry impossible incidentally; that is not a modeled CR 605.3c invariant."
